==Trivia==
*[[Coppermine (Uber Rare Cat)|Coppermine]] is a reference to Mari Illustrious, as described in [[Nyanko Ecology Report Large Edition]].
**Coincidentally, Mari, alongside her [[EVA Unit-08 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA unit]] and [[Mari Cat (Rare Cat)|Cat equivalent]] are all dedicated [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] units, the same as Coppermine prior to being given [[Talents|Ultra Talents]].

